    "stop the case daemon",
    "verify the socket and state root are gone"
  ],
  "untested": [
    "no product runs it yet: only the person in the verified cmux app (the frontend actor) releases a held delivery, and a delivery is held only when an agent (a terminal actor) sends into another workspace; the case connection is a plain local client. p15-oracle-240 gives driver_daemon.py 237's user connection for the release and a fixture-terminal sender for the held delivery"
